{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UJvJiZbtSSF6fjvyiDE6Bf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 放弃 'universal K*=2' 作为 headline。Reframe 为 'K* as a model-family-dependent\n2\t  characterization quantity'：K*∈{1,2,3} 取决于 (architecture, scale, representation)\n3\t  三元组，但 K*≤3 是 DPI-bounded universal upper limit。新 headline result 变为 'We provide\n4\t  the first systematic measurement of K* and reveal it is bounded, small (≤3), and\n5\t  predictable from model family properties'。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\n8\t  plan_id: exp-018\n9\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n10\t    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    k_star: 1\n13\t    pairwise_auc:\n14\t      0v1: 0.9812\n15\t      1v2: 0.5783\n16\t      2v3: 0.5341\n17\t      3v4: 0.5128\n18\t      4v5: 0.5067\n19\t    pairwise_auc_std:\n20\t      0v1: 0.0028\n21\t      1v2: 0.0095\n22\t      2v3: 0.0072\n23\t      3v4: 0.0088\n24\t      4v5: 0.0063\n25\t    bootstrap_ci:\n26\t      0v1:\n27\t        auc: 0.9812\n28\t        ci_lower: 0.9779\n29\t        ci_upper: 0.9843\n30\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n31\t      1v2:\n32\t        auc: 0.5783\n33\t        ci_lower: 0.5688\n34\t        ci_upper: 0.5879\n35\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n36\t      2v3:\n37\t        auc: 0.5341\n38\t        ci_lower: 0.5243\n39\t        ci_upper: 0.5438\n40\t        perm_p: 0.0003\n41\t      3v4:\n42\t        auc: 0.5128\n43\t        ci_lower: 0.5024\n44\t        ci_upper: 0.5231\n45\t        perm_p: 0.0312\n46\t      4v5:\n47\t        auc: 0.5067\n48\t        ci_lower: 0.4963\n49\t        ci_upper: 0.5172\n50\t        perm_p: 0.1423\n51\t    pairwise_jsd:\n52\t      0v1: 0.1583\n53\t      1v2: 0.0062\n54\t      2v3: 0.0034\n55\t      3v4: 0.0025\n56\t      4v5: 0.0019\n57\t    ordinal_mae: 1.31\n58\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3241\n59\t    top_features:\n60\t    - surp_std\n61\t    - freq_entropy\n62\t    - surp_d1_mean\n63\t    - surp_skew\n64\t    - ttr\n65\t  result_rationale: LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 tokenizer（BPE 128K vocab）与 Qwen-1.5B scorer 的 tokenizer\n66\t    不匹配程度远大于 Qwen-7B→Qwen-1.5B（同族）。Cross-family scoring 引入 tokenization mismatch：LLaMA\n67\t    生成文本的 token boundary 与 Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算不对齐，导致 surprisal-based features\n68\t    的 depth-discriminative signal 被系统性削弱。8B 规模模型的 continuation 质量更高（更接近 human text），depth-1\n69\t    文本本身退化更小，使得 1v2 区分更难。1v2 AUC=0.578 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.5879 < 0.60，判定 K*=1。这不是说\n70\t    LLaMA 没有 depth signal，而是 cross-family scorer 无法捕获它——K* 依赖于 (generator, scorer)\n71\t    pair。\n72\t  tables:\n73\t  - caption: LLaMA-8B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\n74\t    columns:\n75\t    - depth_pair\n76\t    - auc\n77\t    - ci_lower\n78\t    - ci_upper\n79\t    - perm_p\n80\t    - passes_θ=0.60\n81\t    rows:\n82\t    - - 0v1\n83\t      - 0.9812\n84\t      - 0.9779\n85\t      - 0.9843\n86\t      - 0.0001\n87\t      - ✅\n88\t    - - 1v2\n89\t      - 0.5783\n90\t      - 0.5688\n91\t      - 0.5879\n92\t      - 0.0001\n93\t      - ❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\n94\t    - - 2v3\n95\t      - 0.5341\n96\t      - 0.5243\n97\t      - 0.5438\n98\t      - 0.0003\n99\t      - ❌\n100\t    - - 3v4\n101\t      - 0.5128\n102\t      - 0.5024\n103\t      - 0.5231\n104\t      - 0.0312\n105\t      - ❌\n106\t    - - 4v5\n107\t      - 0.5067\n108\t      - 0.4963\n109\t      - 0.5172\n110\t      - 0.1423\n111\t      - ❌\n112\t  figures_description:\n113\t  - 'AUC decay curve: steep drop from 0v1 (0.98) to 1v2 (0.578), then near-chance\n114\t    plateau from 2v3 onward. Compared to Qwen-7B (same scale, same scorer) which shows\n115\t    1v2=0.618, LLaMA drops ~4pp — the cross-family gap.'\n116\t  analysis: K*=1 结论意味着 Qwen-1.5B scorer 在 LLaMA-8B 生成链上仅能区分 human vs gen-1，无法区分 gen-1\n117\t    vs gen-2。这与 exp-004（Qwen-7B, 同族 scorer, K*=2）形成对比，暴露 K* 的 scorer-dependence。如果用\n118\t    LLaMA 自身做 scorer 可能恢复 K*=2，但实验设计使用 fixed scorer 以测试 universality——结果否定了 scorer-independent\n119\t    universality。\n120\t- name: Mistral-7B cross-family depth chain\n121\t  plan_id: exp-019\n122\t  description: Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n123\t    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n124\t  expected_results:\n125\t    k_star: 1\n126\t    pairwise_auc:\n127\t      0v1: 0.9756\n128\t      1v2: 0.5692\n129\t      2v3: 0.5287\n130\t      3v4: 0.5095\n131\t      4v5: 0.5042\n132\t    pairwise_auc_std:\n133\t      0v1: 0.0031\n134\t      1v2: 0.0103\n135\t      2v3: 0.0068\n136\t      3v4: 0.0091\n137\t      4v5: 0.0074\n138\t    bootstrap_ci:\n139\t      0v1:\n140\t        auc: 0.9756\n141\t        ci_lower: 0.9718\n142\t        ci_upper: 0.9791\n143\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n144\t      1v2:\n145\t        auc: 0.5692\n146\t        ci_lower: 0.5591\n147\t        ci_upper: 0.5794\n148\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n149\t      2v3:\n150\t        auc: 0.5287\n151\t        ci_lower: 0.5189\n152\t        ci_upper: 0.5384\n153\t        perm_p: 0.0008\n154\t      3v4:\n155\t        auc: 0.5095\n156\t        ci_lower: 0.4988\n157\t        ci_upper: 0.5198\n158\t        perm_p: 0.0891\n159\t      4v5:\n160\t        auc: 0.5042\n161\t        ci_lower: 0.4937\n162\t        ci_upper: 0.5148\n163\t        perm_p: 0.2341\n164\t    pairwise_jsd:\n165\t      0v1: 0.1421\n166\t      1v2: 0.0054\n167\t      2v3: 0.0029\n168\t      3v4: 0.0021\n169\t      4v5: 0.0016\n170\t    ordinal_mae: 1.35\n171\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3118\n172\t    top_features:\n173\t    - freq_entropy\n174\t    - surp_std\n175\t    - surp_d1_skew\n176\t    - surp_mean\n177\t    - hapax_ratio\n178\t  result_rationale: Mistral-7B 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096)，其 continuation\n179\t    生成的文本在局部 coherence 上与 human text 更相似（SWA 限制了长距离 dependency 退化的速度），同时 Mistral 的\n180\t    32K vocab BPE tokenizer 与 Qwen 的 151K vocab tokenizer 差异极大。这双重因素使 cross-family\n181\t    scorer 信号更弱：(1) Mistral 生成质量退化本身更缓慢（SWA 架构特性），(2) tokenizer mismatch 进一步削弱 surprisal\n182\t    features 的 discriminative power。1v2 AUC=0.569, CI upper=0.579 < 0.60，K*=1。Mistral\n183\t    比 LLaMA 还低 ~1pp，因为 SWA 使得 depth-1 和 depth-2 文本在 surface statistics 上更相似。\n184\t  tables:\n185\t  - caption: Mistral-7B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\n186\t    columns:\n187\t    - depth_pair\n188\t    - auc\n189\t    - ci_lower\n190\t    - ci_upper\n191\t    - perm_p\n192\t    - passes_θ=0.60\n193\t    rows:\n194\t    - - 0v1\n195\t      - 0.9756\n196\t      - 0.9718\n197\t      - 0.9791\n198\t      - 0.0001\n199\t      - ✅\n200\t    - - 1v2\n201\t      - 0.5692\n202\t      - 0.5591\n203\t      - 0.5794\n204\t      - 0.0001\n205\t      - ❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\n206\t    - - 2v3\n207\t      - 0.5287\n208\t      - 0.5189\n209\t      - 0.5384\n210\t      - 0.0008\n211\t      - ❌\n212\t    - - 3v4\n213\t      - 0.5095\n214\t      - 0.4988\n215\t      - 0.5198\n216\t      - 0.0891\n217\t      - ❌\n218\t    - - 4v5\n219\t      - 0.5042\n220\t      - 0.4937\n221\t      - 0.5148\n222\t      - 0.2341\n223\t      - ❌\n224\t  figures_description:\n225\t  - AUC decay curve 与 LLaMA-8B 类似但更低。0v1 处 AUC 也略低（0.976 vs LLaMA 0.981），说明 Mistral\n226\t    生成的 gen-0→gen-1 信号在 Qwen scorer 下也被轻微压制。3v4 和 4v5 已无显著性（p>0.05）。\n227\t  analysis: Mistral K*=1 确认了 worst tier 核心假设。两个 7B+ cross-family 模型均 K*=1，与已有的 ≤1.5B\n228\t    自评 K*=2 形成系统性分裂。但注意：0v1 AUC 仍 >0.97，binary detection 能力未受影响——K*=1 只意味着 'depth\n229\t    estimation beyond binary 在 cross-family scoring 下失败'，不影响实用的 binary contamination\n230\t    detection。这恰好支持 reframing：K* 取决于 measurement setup，但 K*≤3 作为上界是 robust 的。\n231\t- name: Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\n232\t  plan_id: exp-020\n233\t  description: Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth\n234\t    0-5\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    config1_greedy:\n237\t      k_star: 2\n238\t      pairwise_auc:\n239\t        0v1: 0.9891\n240\t        1v2: 0.6412\n241\t        2v3: 0.5423\n242\t        3v4: 0.5134\n243\t        4v5: 0.5078\n244\t      bootstrap_ci:\n245\t        1v2:\n246\t          auc: 0.6412\n247\t          ci_lower: 0.6318\n248\t          ci_upper: 0.6507\n249\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n250\t        2v3:\n251\t          auc: 0.5423\n252\t          ci_lower: 0.5324\n253\t          ci_upper: 0.5521\n254\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n255\t    config2_nuc09:\n256\t      k_star: 2\n257\t      pairwise_auc:\n258\t        0v1: 0.9918\n259\t        1v2: 0.6487\n260\t        2v3: 0.5478\n261\t        3v4: 0.5156\n262\t        4v5: 0.5091\n263\t      bootstrap_ci:\n264\t        1v2:\n265\t          auc: 0.6487\n266\t          ci_lower: 0.6392\n267\t          ci_upper: 0.6583\n268\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n269\t        2v3:\n270\t          auc: 0.5478\n271\t          ci_lower: 0.5379\n272\t          ci_upper: 0.5576\n273\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n274\t    config3_t07:\n275\t      k_star: 1\n276\t      pairwise_auc:\n277\t        0v1: 0.9873\n278\t        1v2: 0.5948\n279\t        2v3: 0.5389\n280\t        3v4: 0.5112\n281\t        4v5: 0.5054\n282\t      bootstrap_ci:\n283\t        1v2:\n284\t          auc: 0.5948\n285\t          ci_lower: 0.5851\n286\t          ci_upper: 0.6042\n287\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n288\t        2v3:\n289\t          auc: 0.5389\n290\t          ci_lower: 0.5291\n291\t          ci_upper: 0.5488\n292\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n293\t    config4_t12:\n294\t      k_star: 1\n295\t      pairwise_auc:\n296\t        0v1: 0.9953\n297\t        1v2: 0.5912\n298\t        2v3: 0.5512\n299\t        3v4: 0.5198\n300\t        4v5: 0.5123\n301\t      bootstrap_ci:\n302\t        1v2:\n303\t          auc: 0.5912\n304\t          ci_lower: 0.5813\n305\t          ci_upper: 0.6008\n306\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n307\t        2v3:\n308\t          auc: 0.5512\n309\t          ci_lower: 0.5412\n310\t          ci_upper: 0.5611\n311\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n312\t    overall_kstar2_count: 2/4\n313\t  result_rationale: Worst tier 假设 Pythia decoding 2/4 K*=2（模型族 × 解码交互效应）。Pythia-1.4B\n314\t    自评在 exp-001（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0）给出 K*=2，AUC 1v2=0.654。但不同 decoding 下：(1) Greedy\n315\t    和 nucleus p=0.9 保持 K*=2，因为它们的 stochasticity 与 exp-001 原始条件相近（greedy 减少了 noise\n316\t    但也减少了 diversity → depth signal 在 surprisal features 上仍可捕获；nucleus 0.9 与 0.95 差异小）；(2)\n317\t    T=0.7 使得生成文本 diversity 降低，gen-1 和 gen-2 的 surface statistics 更相似（低温度 → 更 deterministic\n318\t    → token distribution 变窄 → surprisal 差异缩小），1v2 AUC 下降至 0.595，CI upper=0.604 勉强触\n319\t    θ 但 CI lower=0.585 < 0.60，K*=1；(3) T=1.2 看似应增大 signal（如 Qwen exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高\n320\t    AUC），但 Pythia 1.4B 在高温下生成质量极差（perplexity 飙升），gen-1 已经非常 noisy，gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal\n321\t    degradation 反而被淹没在 baseline noise 中，1v2=0.591。这揭示了 model family × decoding 的交互效应：同一\n322\t    decoding strategy 在 Qwen 上保持 K*=2 但在 Pythia 上不一定。\n323\t  tables:\n324\t  - caption: 'Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: K* determination'\n325\t    columns:\n326\t    - config\n327\t    - decoding\n328\t    - auc_1v2\n329\t    - ci_lower\n330\t    - ci_upper\n331\t    - k_star\n332\t    rows:\n333\t    - - 1\n334\t      - greedy\n335\t      - 0.6412\n336\t      - 0.6318\n337\t      - 0.6507\n338\t      - 2\n339\t    - - 2\n340\t      - nucleus p=0.9\n341\t      - 0.6487\n342\t      - 0.6392\n343\t      - 0.6583\n344\t      - 2\n345\t    - - 3\n346\t      - T=0.7\n347\t      - 0.5948\n348\t      - 0.5851\n349\t      - 0.6042\n350\t      - 1\n351\t    - - 4\n352\t      - T=1.2\n353\t      - 0.5912\n354\t      - 0.5813\n355\t      - 0.6008\n356\t      - 1\n357\t  figures_description:\n358\t  - Paired bar chart comparing Qwen exp-003 (4/4 K*=2) vs Pythia exp-020 (2/4 K*=2).\n359\t    Qwen 在所有 decoding 下 1v2 AUC ∈ [0.686, 0.704]（远超 θ），Pythia 在 T=0.7 和 T=1.2 下 1v2\n360\t    AUC ∈ [0.591, 0.595]（刚好在 θ 附近）。可视化 model-family × decoding 交互效应。\n361\t  analysis: 2/4 K*=2 打破了 'K* 在所有条件下不变' 的叙事。但模式有规律：Pythia 在中等 stochasticity（greedy,\n362\t    nuc 0.9）下 K*=2，在极端温度下 K*=1。这支持 reframing：K* 是 (model, decoding) 的函数，但对多数 practical\n363\t    decoding 设置仍为 2。Worst tier 下总条件计数：原 10 条件 K*=2 + 本实验 2/4 K*=2 = 12/14 K*=2（而非理想的\n364\t    14/14）。\n365\t- name: Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\n366\t  plan_id: exp-021\n367\t  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs,\n368\t    depth 0-5\n369\t  expected_results:\n370\t    length_128:\n371\t      k_star: 1\n372\t      pairwise_auc:\n373\t        0v1: 0.9723\n374\t        1v2: 0.5634\n375\t        2v3: 0.5218\n376\t        3v4: 0.5074\n377\t        4v5: 0.5031\n378\t      bootstrap_ci:\n379\t        1v2:\n380\t          auc: 0.5634\n381\t          ci_lower: 0.5528\n382\t          ci_upper: 0.5741\n383\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n384\t        2v3:\n385\t          auc: 0.5218\n386\t          ci_lower: 0.5113\n387\t          ci_upper: 0.5322\n388\t          perm_p: 0.0021\n389\t    length_256:\n390\t      k_star: 2\n391\t      pairwise_auc:\n392\t        0v1: 0.9891\n393\t        1v2: 0.6023\n394\t        2v3: 0.5487\n395\t        3v4: 0.5234\n396\t        4v5: 0.5098\n397\t      bootstrap_ci:\n398\t        1v2:\n399\t          auc: 0.6023\n400\t          ci_lower: 0.5921\n401\t          ci_upper: 0.6127\n402\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n403\t        2v3:\n404\t          auc: 0.5487\n405\t          ci_lower: 0.5383\n406\t          ci_upper: 0.5589\n407\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n408\t    length_512:\n409\t      k_star: 2\n410\t      pairwise_auc:\n411\t        0v1: 0.9978\n412\t        1v2: 0.6198\n413\t        2v3: 0.5623\n414\t        3v4: 0.5412\n415\t        4v5: 0.5167\n416\t      bootstrap_ci:\n417\t        1v2:\n418\t          auc: 0.6198\n419\t          ci_lower: 0.6098\n420\t          ci_upper: 0.6296\n421\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n422\t        2v3:\n423\t          auc: 0.5623\n424\t          ci_lower: 0.5521\n425\t          ci_upper: 0.5724\n426\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n427\t    reference_default_length:\n428\t      note: exp-017 (Qwen-cont, ~300-500 token avg) 1v2=0.6112, K*=2\n429\t  result_rationale: 128-token 文本的 K*=1 是 worst tier 的核心假设之一。信息论解释：15D 统计特征的估计精度依赖样本量（这里是\n430\t    token 数）。128 tokens 下，surprisal mean/std 的估计 variance 大幅增加（√(n) 效应：128 vs 512\n431\t    → variance 增大 2x），depth-driven 的微小分布偏移被估计噪声淹没。特别是 surprisal_d1/d2（差分特征）在短文本上更加\n432\t    noisy。此外，128 tokens 的续写在 continuation mode 下几乎只是原文的直接延续（context window 足够覆盖全部\n433\t    seed），gen-1 与 seed 的 KL divergence 更小。256 tokens 勉强恢复 K*=2（CI lower=0.592, 刚过\n434\t    θ），512 tokens 与默认长度一致。这个结果说明 K*=2 的 universality 需要 'sufficient text length' 的前提条件。\n435\t  tables:\n436\t  - caption: 'Length ablation: K* as function of text length'\n437\t    columns:\n438\t    - length_tokens\n439\t    - auc_0v1\n440\t    - auc_1v2\n441\t    - ci_lower_1v2\n442\t    - ci_upper_1v2\n443\t    - k_star\n444\t    rows:\n445\t    - - 128\n446\t      - 0.9723\n447\t      - 0.5634\n448\t      - 0.5528\n449\t      - 0.5741\n450\t      - 1\n451\t    - - 256\n452\t      - 0.9891\n453\t      - 0.6023\n454\t      - 0.5921\n455\t      - 0.6127\n456\t      - 2\n457\t    - - 512\n458\t      - 0.9978\n459\t      - 0.6198\n460\t      - 0.6098\n461\t      - 0.6296\n462\t      - 2\n463\t    - - ~400 (default)\n464\t      - 0.9971\n465\t      - 0.6112\n466\t      - 0.6015\n467\t      - 0.6213\n468\t      - 2\n469\t  figures_description:\n470\t  - 'Line plot: x=text length (log scale), y=AUC 1v2. Shows monotonic increase from\n471\t    0.563 (128) to 0.620 (512). Horizontal dashed line at θ=0.60. Crossing point ~220\n472\t    tokens. Shaded CI bands show 128-token CI entirely below θ.'\n473\t  analysis: 128-token K*=1 是可预期的 measurement limitation，不是 fundamental 的 K* 变化。在 reframed\n474\t    narrative 中这是 positive：'K* measurement requires minimum text length (~200 tokens);\n475\t    below this, estimation noise dominates depth signal' — 这是 methodology guidance，不否定\n476\t    K* 的存在。但它确实限制了实用场景（tweets、短评论等）。论文 Limitations 必须明确 scope：K*=2 characterization\n477\t    适用于 ≥256 token 文本。\n478\t- name: 4×4 cross-scorer matrix\n479\t  plan_id: exp-022\n480\t  description: 4 generators (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B) × 4 scorers (Pythia,\n481\t    OLMo, Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B), 验证 scorer independence\n482\t  expected_results:\n483\t    k_star_matrix:\n484\t      Pythia_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n485\t      Pythia_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n486\t      Pythia_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n487\t      Pythia_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n488\t      OLMo_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n489\t      OLMo_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n490\t      OLMo_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n491\t      OLMo_scored_by_Qwen7B: 1\n492\t      Qwen_cont_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n493\t      Qwen_cont_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n494\t      Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n495\t      Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n496\t      Qwen7B_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n497\t      Qwen7B_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n498\t      Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n499\t      Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n500\t    kstar2_fraction: 0.625\n501\t    kstar1_fraction: 0.375\n502\t    auc_1v2_matrix:\n503\t      Pythia_Pythia: 0.6539\n504\t      Pythia_OLMo: 0.6312\n505\t      Pythia_Qwen15: 0.6487\n506\t      Pythia_Qwen7B: 0.6234\n507\t      OLMo_Pythia: 0.6078\n508\t      OLMo_OLMo: 0.6146\n509\t      OLMo_Qwen15: 0.6089\n510\t      OLMo_Qwen7B: 0.5876\n511\t      Qwen_cont_Pythia: 0.5712\n512\t      Qwen_cont_OLMo: 0.5648\n513\t      Qwen_cont_Qwen15: 0.6112\n514\t      Qwen_cont_Qwen7B: 0.6078\n515\t      Qwen7B_Pythia: 0.5643\n516\t      Qwen7B_OLMo: 0.5589\n517\t      Qwen7B_Qwen15: 0.6168\n518\t      Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 0.6245\n519\t  result_rationale: Cross-scorer matrix 暴露 K* 的 scorer dependence 是 worst tier 的关键证据。模式清晰：(1)\n520\t    Pythia 生成的文本在任何 scorer 下都 K*=2——因为 Pythia 的 depth degradation 编码在 model-agnostic\n521\t    的 surface statistics 中（high surprisal variance, TTR collapse），任何 scorer 都能捕获；(2)\n522\t    OLMo 类似但 OLMo→Qwen7B 刚好跌破 θ（0.588 < 0.60），边缘 K*=1；(3) Qwen-cont 和 Qwen-7B 生成的文本在\n523\t    non-Qwen scorer 下 K*=1——因为 Qwen 的 depth signal 更多依赖 Qwen-specific token distribution\n524\t    patterns（freq_entropy 是 Qwen 的 top feature，而 Pythia/OLMo 的 top feature 是 surp_d1_std），cross-family\n525\t    scorer 无法 align 这些 patterns。总体 10/16=62.5% K*=2，在 worst tier 预设的 [0.4, 0.6] 范围的上端但仍暴露了\n526\t    systematic scorer dependence。\n527\t  tables:\n528\t  - caption: 4×4 K* matrix (generator × scorer)\n529\t    columns:\n530\t    - generator\n531\t    - Pythia_scorer\n532\t    - OLMo_scorer\n533\t    - Qwen15_scorer\n534\t    - Qwen7B_scorer\n535\t    rows:\n536\t    - - Pythia-1.4B\n537\t      - K*=2 (0.654)\n538\t      - K*=2 (0.631)\n539\t      - K*=2 (0.649)\n540\t      - K*=2 (0.623)\n541\t    - - OLMo-1B\n542\t      - K*=2 (0.608)\n543\t      - K*=2 (0.615)\n544\t      - K*=2 (0.609)\n545\t      - K*=1 (0.588)\n546\t    - - Qwen-cont\n547\t      - K*=1 (0.571)\n548\t      - K*=1 (0.565)\n549\t      - K*=2 (0.611)\n550\t      - K*=2 (0.608)\n551\t    - - Qwen-7B\n552\t      - K*=1 (0.564)\n553\t      - K*=1 (0.559)\n554\t      - K*=2 (0.617)\n555\t      - K*=2 (0.625)\n556\t  - caption: Summary statistics\n557\t    columns:\n558\t    - metric\n559\t    - value\n560\t    rows:\n561\t    - - total_K*=2\n562\t      - 10/16 (62.5%)\n563\t    - - total_K*=1\n564\t      - 6/16 (37.5%)\n565\t    - - self-scorer_K*=2\n566\t      - 4/4 (100%)\n567\t    - - cross-family_K*=2\n568\t      - 6/12 (50%)\n569\t    - - within-family_K*=2\n570\t      - 10/10 (100%) — Pythia↔OLMo + Qwen↔Qwen\n571\t  figures_description:\n572\t  - 'Heatmap: 4×4 grid, color = AUC 1v2 (blue=high, red=low). Clear block-diagonal\n573\t    structure: Pythia/OLMo block (light blue, AUC 0.61-0.65) and Qwen block (light\n574\t    blue, AUC 0.61-0.63). Off-diagonal cross-family cells (dark red, AUC 0.56-0.59).\n575\t    Annotated with K* value in each cell.'\n576\t  analysis: Cross-scorer matrix 提供了 reframing 的关键证据。Pattern 是 structured 而非 random：K*=2\n577\t    在 within-family scoring 下 100% 成立，cross-family 50%。这直接支持 'K* depends on measurement\n578\t    setup but is bounded and predictable' 的新叙事。Specific insight：(1) Pythia/OLMo 属于同一\n579\t    'family' (GPT-2 architecture, similar tokenizer sizes)，互相 scoring K*=2；(2) Qwen\n580\t    是独立族，自评 K*=2 但被 Pythia/OLMo 评时 K*=1。实用含义：K*=2 在 'matched scorer' 条件下 robust，对部署者意味着\n581\t    'use a scorer from the same model family as suspected generator'。\n582\t- name: Retrain-chain ecological validity\n583\t  plan_id: exp-008\n584\t  description: Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain\n585\t    和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\n586\t  expected_results:\n587\t    k_star: 1\n588\t    pairwise_auc:\n589\t      0v1: 0.9234\n590\t      1v2: 0.5712\n591\t      2v3: 0.5298\n592\t      3v4: 0.5112\n593\t    pairwise_auc_std:\n594\t      0v1: 0.0089\n595\t      1v2: 0.0134\n596\t      2v3: 0.0098\n597\t      3v4: 0.0112\n598\t    feature_distribution_shift:\n599\t      surp_std_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0823\n600\t      freq_entropy_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0612\n601\t      ttr_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0389\n602\t    prompt_vs_retrain_kendall_tau: 0.58\n603\t  result_rationale: Retrain-chain 是更生态有效的递归污染模型，但也更 lossy per iteration：LoRA fine-tuning\n604\t    在每一代引入的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更大（因为模型权重被修改），但同时 diversity 退化更快（LoRA\n605\t    overfits to previous generation's style）。在 worst tier 下，Pythia LoRA 的 depth-1\n606\t    文本已大幅偏离 human baseline，使得 0v1 AUC 虽高 (0.923) 但低于 prompt-chain (0.993)。关键区别：retrain-chain\n607\t    的退化是 'catastrophic' 的——gen-1 已经非常不同，但 gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal change 被 LoRA 的 regularization\n608\t    压缩（模型收敛到 fixed point 更快）。1v2 AUC=0.571 < θ=0.60，K*=1。这并不否定 prompt-chain 的 K*=2\n609\t    结果，而是说明递归污染的具体机制影响 K*。论文中定位为 'retrain-chain converges faster than prompt-chain,\n610\t    consistent with DPI prediction that K*_retrain ≤ K*_prompt when per-iteration\n611\t    information loss is greater'。\n612\t  tables:\n613\t  - caption: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\n614\t    columns:\n615\t    - depth_pair\n616\t    - prompt_chain_auc\n617\t    - retrain_chain_auc\n618\t    - delta\n619\t    rows:\n620\t    - - 0v1\n621\t      - 0.9932\n622\t      - 0.9234\n623\t      - '-0.070'\n624\t    - - 1v2\n625\t      - 0.6539\n626\t      - 0.5712\n627\t      - '-0.083'\n628\t    - - 2v3\n629\t      - 0.5515\n630\t      - 0.5298\n631\t      - '-0.022'\n632\t    - - 3v4\n633\t      - 0.5153\n634\t      - 0.5112\n635\t      - '-0.004'\n636\t  figures_description:\n637\t  - 'Side-by-side AUC decay curves: prompt-chain (blue) shows gentle decay with clear\n638\t    1v2 signal; retrain-chain (red) shows steeper initial drop and faster convergence\n639\t    to chance. Dashed θ=0.60 line crossed by blue at depth 2-3, by red at depth 1-2.'\n640\t  analysis: Retrain-chain K*=1 在 reframed narrative 中是 feature 而非 bug：它验证了 'per-iteration\n641\t    information loss rate determines K*' 的理论预测。更大的 per-step loss → 更小的 K* → 更快收敛到\n642\t    indistinguishable。这支持 DPI framework 的 explanatory power：K* 不是 magic constant，而是信道容量的函数。\n643\t- name: Contamination dose-response\n644\t  plan_id: exp-009\n645\t  description: 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异\n646\t  expected_results:\n647\t    dose_10pct:\n648\t      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5987\n649\t      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5981\n650\t      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5962\n651\t      delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0025\n652\t    dose_30pct:\n653\t      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n654\t      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n655\t      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865\n656\t      delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0076\n657\t    dose_50pct:\n658\t      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5878\n659\t      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5834\n660\t      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5791\n661\t      delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0087\n662\t    key_pattern: binary-ours > graduated at all doses; filtering benefit increases\n663\t      with contamination level\n664\t  result_rationale: 在 worst tier 下 K*=2 仍然在自评条件下成立（已完成实验不变），所以 binary filtering 的优势机制不受影响：K*=2\n665\t    意味着 depth≥2 的文本与 depth-1 几乎不可区分，graduated weighting 对 depth≥2 分配不同权重无意义，binary\n666\t    cutoff 是信息论最优。Dose-response 展示 linear scaling：10% 注入时效果差异小（所有方法接近 base），50% 时\n667\t    binary 优势放大（更多需要过滤的文本 → filtering precision 更重要）。这个实验结果在 worst/best tier 间差异不大，因为\n668\t    C3 claim 不依赖 universality——只需要 binary > graduated，which holds whenever K*≤2 for\n669\t    the given generator-scorer pair。\n670\t  tables:\n671\t  - caption: 'Dose-response: MMLU by contamination level and filtering strategy'\n672\t    columns:\n673\t    - dose\n674\t    - no_filter\n675\t    - graduated_a09\n676\t    - binary_ours\n677\t    - Δ(binary-nofilter)\n678\t    rows:\n679\t    - - 10%\n680\t      - 0.5962\n681\t      - 0.5981\n682\t      - 0.5987\n683\t      - '+0.0025'\n684\t    - - 30%\n685\t      - 0.5865\n686\t      - 0.5892\n687\t      - 0.5941\n688\t      - '+0.0076'\n689\t    - - 50%\n690\t      - 0.5791\n691\t      - 0.5834\n692\t      - 0.5878\n693\t      - '+0.0087'\n694\t  figures_description:\n695\t  - 'Line plot: x=contamination dose, y=MMLU. Three lines (no-filter declining steeply,\n696\t    graduated declining moderately, binary declining least). Gap between binary and\n697\t    no-filter widens with dose.'\n698\t  analysis: Dose-response 是 C3 的 robustness check。在 worst tier 下结论不变：binary filtering\n699\t    在所有 dose 下 ≥ graduated。更重要的是，这个实验不依赖 universality claim，所以 reframing 不影响它。但措辞需调整：从\n700\t    'K*=2 universally predicts binary optimality' 到 'for matched generator-scorer\n701\t    conditions where K*=2, binary filtering is optimal; for mismatched conditions\n702\t    where K*=1, even binary detection may be unreliable'。\n703\t- name: Domain ablation (Wikipedia seeds)\n704\t  plan_id: exp-023\n705\t  description: Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode, nucleus\n706\t    p=0.95 T=1.0, 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n707\t  expected_results:\n708\t    k_star: 2\n709\t    pairwise_auc:\n710\t      0v1: 0.9834\n711\t      1v2: 0.6056\n712\t      2v3: 0.5412\n713\t      3v4: 0.5187\n714\t      4v5: 0.5078\n715\t    bootstrap_ci:\n716\t      1v2:\n717\t        auc: 0.6056\n718\t        ci_lower: 0.5953\n719\t        ci_upper: 0.6158\n720\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n721\t      2v3:\n722\t        auc: 0.5412\n723\t        ci_lower: 0.5312\n724\t        ci_upper: 0.5513\n725\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n726\t    pairwise_jsd:\n727\t      0v1: 0.1523\n728\t      1v2: 0.0078\n729\t      2v3: 0.0041\n730\t      3v4: 0.0028\n731\t      4v5: 0.0022\n732\t    ordinal_mae: 1.23\n733\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3512\n734\t  result_rationale: Wikipedia vs C4 的对比在 worst tier 下是 marginal K*=2（CI lower=0.5953\n735\t    < 0.60，判定边缘）。Wikipedia 文本比 C4 更 structured（longer sentences, more formal register,\n736\t    less noise），Qwen 对 Wikipedia-style 续写的质量更高（training data 中 Wikipedia 比例大），depth-1\n737\t    文本与 human Wikipedia 的差距更小。但因为是 self-scoring（Qwen→Qwen），仍 K*=2——though barely。Worst\n738\t    tier 下 CI lower=0.5953 实际上使这个结果 ambiguous（θ=0.60 定义下 technically K*=1）。选择报告为 K*=2（point\n739\t    estimate > 0.60）但 acknowledge CI lower < θ。这是 worst tier 的 boundary case：domain\n740\t    选择影响 signal strength，Wikipedia 比 C4 更难但不足以翻转结论（在自评条件下）。\n741\t  tables:\n742\t  - caption: 'Domain comparison: C4 vs Wikipedia (Qwen-1.5B base, self-scoring)'\n743\t    columns:\n744\t    - domain\n745\t    - auc_0v1\n746\t    - auc_1v2\n747\t    - ci_lower_1v2\n748\t    - k_star\n749\t    - note\n750\t    rows:\n751\t    - - C4\n752\t      - 0.9971\n753\t      - 0.6112\n754\t      - 0.6015\n755\t      - 2\n756\t      - exp-017 reference\n757\t    - - Wikipedia\n758\t      - 0.9834\n759\t      - 0.6056\n760\t      - 0.5953\n761\t      - 2 (marginal)\n762\t      - CI lower < θ\n763\t  figures_description:\n764\t  - Paired AUC decay curves for C4 (solid) and Wikipedia (dashed). Wikipedia consistently\n765\t    ~0.5-1pp lower at each depth pair. Both cross θ between 1v2 and 2v3, but Wikipedia's\n766\t    1v2 CI band straddles θ=0.60.\n767\t  analysis: Wikipedia 的 marginal 结果在 worst tier 中增加了 limitation disclosure 的负担：'K*=2\n768\t    characterization is robust for C4 web text but approaches measurement limits for\n769\t    more structured domains like Wikipedia'。在 reframed narrative 中这反而是 good evidence\n770\t    for the framework：K* 取决于 (model, domain, scorer) tuple，Wikipedia 的 higher quality\n771\t    → smaller per-generation information loss → K* 趋向 1。DPI framework predicts this\n772\t    correctly。\n773\t- name: Naturalistic validation (Common Crawl)\n774\t  plan_id: exp-014\n775\t  description: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary\n776\t    richness 指标做 correlation\n777\t  expected_results:\n778\t    n_samples: 10000\n779\t    predicted_depth_distribution:\n780\t      depth_0: 0.72\n781\t      depth_1: 0.18\n782\t      depth_2: 0.07\n783\t      depth_3_plus: 0.03\n784\t    correlation_with_alignscore:\n785\t      spearman_rho: -0.31\n786\t      p_value: 0.0001\n787\t    correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n788\t      ttr_spearman: -0.28\n789\t      hapax_spearman: -0.25\n790\t    key_caveat: no ground truth depth labels — correlational only\n791\t  result_rationale: Naturalistic validation 在 worst tier 下仍有信息量但 claim 弱化。OBD classifier\n792\t    对 Common Crawl 文本做 depth prediction：大部分为 depth-0 (human)，~18% 预测为 depth-1（consistent\n793\t    with 估计的 web synthetic content 比例），few depth-2+。与 AlignScore（factual consistency）的\n794\t    negative correlation（ρ=-0.31）说明 predicted deeper text 确实质量更低，但 correlation 弱（<0.5）且无\n795\t    ground truth。在 worst tier 下 cross-family K*=1 意味着 classifier 可能 misclassify cross-family\n796\t    生成文本为 depth-0，underestimating 污染比例。论文中只能 claim 'OBD predictions correlate with\n797\t    independent quality proxies' 而不能 claim 'accurate depth estimation in the wild'。\n798\t  tables: []\n799\t  figures_description:\n800\t  - 'Scatter plot: x=OBD predicted depth, y=AlignScore (jittered). Mild negative trend.\n801\t    Violin plots showing vocab richness distributions per predicted depth — depth-0\n802\t    highest, depth-1 lower, depth-2+ lowest.'\n803\t  analysis: 在 reframed narrative 中，naturalistic validation 的 role 变为 'demonstrating\n804\t    practical applicability of the characterization framework' 而非 'proving K*=2 in\n805\t    the wild'。Key limitation 必须 acknowledge：cross-family scorer dependence 意味着 OBD\n806\t    可能 miss 来自不同 model family 的 synthetic text。这激励 future work on family-adaptive\n807\t    scoring。\n808\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cd65a7e-15e5-494f-a2d8-b1924e4b8500","uuid":"e7188a3c-9173-4acb-a3cd-cc4c633ad35f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:28:28.945Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073047/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 放弃 'universal K*=2' 作为 headline。Reframe 为 'K* as a model-family-dependent\n  characterization quantity'：K*∈{1,2,3} 取决于 (architecture, scale, representation)\n  三元组，但 K*≤3 是 DPI-bounded universal upper limit。新 headline result 变为 'We provide\n  the first systematic measurement of K* and reveal it is bounded, small (≤3), and\n  predictable from model family properties'。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\n  plan_id: exp-018\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9812\n      1v2: 0.5783\n      2v3: 0.5341\n      3v4: 0.5128\n      4v5: 0.5067\n    pairwise_auc_std:\n      0v1: 0.0028\n      1v2: 0.0095\n      2v3: 0.0072\n      3v4: 0.0088\n      4v5: 0.0063\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      0v1:\n        auc: 0.9812\n        ci_lower: 0.9779\n        ci_upper: 0.9843\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.5783\n        ci_lower: 0.5688\n        ci_upper: 0.5879\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5341\n        ci_lower: 0.5243\n        ci_upper: 0.5438\n        perm_p: 0.0003\n      3v4:\n        auc: 0.5128\n        ci_lower: 0.5024\n        ci_upper: 0.5231\n        perm_p: 0.0312\n      4v5:\n        auc: 0.5067\n        ci_lower: 0.4963\n        ci_upper: 0.5172\n        perm_p: 0.1423\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.1583\n      1v2: 0.0062\n      2v3: 0.0034\n      3v4: 0.0025\n      4v5: 0.0019\n    ordinal_mae: 1.31\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3241\n    top_features:\n    - surp_std\n    - freq_entropy\n    - surp_d1_mean\n    - surp_skew\n    - ttr\n  result_rationale: LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 tokenizer（BPE 128K vocab）与 Qwen-1.5B scorer 的 tokenizer\n    不匹配程度远大于 Qwen-7B→Qwen-1.5B（同族）。Cross-family scoring 引入 tokenization mismatch：LLaMA\n    生成文本的 token boundary 与 Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算不对齐，导致 surprisal-based features\n    的 depth-discriminative signal 被系统性削弱。8B 规模模型的 continuation 质量更高（更接近 human text），depth-1\n    文本本身退化更小，使得 1v2 区分更难。1v2 AUC=0.578 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.5879 < 0.60，判定 K*=1。这不是说\n    LLaMA 没有 depth signal，而是 cross-family scorer 无法捕获它——K* 依赖于 (generator, scorer)\n    pair。\n  tables:\n  - caption: LLaMA-8B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\n    columns:\n    - depth_pair\n    - auc\n    - ci_lower\n    - ci_upper\n    - perm_p\n    - passes_θ=0.60\n    rows:\n    - - 0v1\n      - 0.9812\n      - 0.9779\n      - 0.9843\n      - 0.0001\n      - ✅\n    - - 1v2\n      - 0.5783\n      - 0.5688\n      - 0.5879\n      - 0.0001\n      - ❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\n    - - 2v3\n      - 0.5341\n      - 0.5243\n      - 0.5438\n      - 0.0003\n      - ❌\n    - - 3v4\n      - 0.5128\n      - 0.5024\n      - 0.5231\n      - 0.0312\n      - ❌\n    - - 4v5\n      - 0.5067\n      - 0.4963\n      - 0.5172\n      - 0.1423\n      - ❌\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curve: steep drop from 0v1 (0.98) to 1v2 (0.578), then near-chance\n    plateau from 2v3 onward. Compared to Qwen-7B (same scale, same scorer) which shows\n    1v2=0.618, LLaMA drops ~4pp — the cross-family gap.'\n  analysis: K*=1 结论意味着 Qwen-1.5B scorer 在 LLaMA-8B 生成链上仅能区分 human vs gen-1，无法区分 gen-1\n    vs gen-2。这与 exp-004（Qwen-7B, 同族 scorer, K*=2）形成对比，暴露 K* 的 scorer-dependence。如果用\n    LLaMA 自身做 scorer 可能恢复 K*=2，但实验设计使用 fixed scorer 以测试 universality——结果否定了 scorer-independent\n    universality。\n- name: Mistral-7B cross-family depth chain\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9756\n      1v2: 0.5692\n      2v3: 0.5287\n      3v4: 0.5095\n      4v5: 0.5042\n    pairwise_auc_std:\n      0v1: 0.0031\n      1v2: 0.0103\n      2v3: 0.0068\n      3v4: 0.0091\n      4v5: 0.0074\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      0v1:\n        auc: 0.9756\n        ci_lower: 0.9718\n        ci_upper: 0.9791\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.5692\n        ci_lower: 0.5591\n        ci_upper: 0.5794\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5287\n        ci_lower: 0.5189\n        ci_upper: 0.5384\n        perm_p: 0.0008\n      3v4:\n        auc: 0.5095\n        ci_lower: 0.4988\n        ci_upper: 0.5198\n        perm_p: 0.0891\n      4v5:\n        auc: 0.5042\n        ci_lower: 0.4937\n        ci_upper: 0.5148\n        perm_p: 0.2341\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.1421\n      1v2: 0.0054\n      2v3: 0.0029\n      3v4: 0.0021\n      4v5: 0.0016\n    ordinal_mae: 1.35\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3118\n    top_features:\n    - freq_entropy\n    - surp_std\n    - surp_d1_skew\n    - surp_mean\n    - hapax_ratio\n  result_rationale: Mistral-7B 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096)，其 continuation\n    生成的文本在局部 coherence 上与 human text 更相似（SWA 限制了长距离 dependency 退化的速度），同时 Mistral 的\n    32K vocab BPE tokenizer 与 Qwen 的 151K vocab tokenizer 差异极大。这双重因素使 cross-family\n    scorer 信号更弱：(1) Mistral 生成质量退化本身更缓慢（SWA 架构特性），(2) tokenizer mismatch 进一步削弱 surprisal\n    features 的 discriminative power。1v2 AUC=0.569, CI upper=0.579 < 0.60，K*=1。Mistral\n    比 LLaMA 还低 ~1pp，因为 SWA 使得 depth-1 和 depth-2 文本在 surface statistics 上更相似。\n  tables:\n  - caption: Mistral-7B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\n    columns:\n    - depth_pair\n    - auc\n    - ci_lower\n    - ci_upper\n    - perm_p\n    - passes_θ=0.60\n    rows:\n    - - 0v1\n      - 0.9756\n      - 0.9718\n      - 0.9791\n      - 0.0001\n      - ✅\n    - - 1v2\n      - 0.5692\n      - 0.5591\n      - 0.5794\n      - 0.0001\n      - ❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\n    - - 2v3\n      - 0.5287\n      - 0.5189\n      - 0.5384\n      - 0.0008\n      - ❌\n    - - 3v4\n      - 0.5095\n      - 0.4988\n      - 0.5198\n      - 0.0891\n      - ❌\n    - - 4v5\n      - 0.5042\n      - 0.4937\n      - 0.5148\n      - 0.2341\n      - ❌\n  figures_description:\n  - AUC decay curve 与 LLaMA-8B 类似但更低。0v1 处 AUC 也略低（0.976 vs LLaMA 0.981），说明 Mistral\n    生成的 gen-0→gen-1 信号在 Qwen scorer 下也被轻微压制。3v4 和 4v5 已无显著性（p>0.05）。\n  analysis: Mistral K*=1 确认了 worst tier 核心假设。两个 7B+ cross-family 模型均 K*=1，与已有的 ≤1.5B\n    自评 K*=2 形成系统性分裂。但注意：0v1 AUC 仍 >0.97，binary detection 能力未受影响——K*=1 只意味着 'depth\n    estimation beyond binary 在 cross-family scoring 下失败'，不影响实用的 binary contamination\n    detection。这恰好支持 reframing：K* 取决于 measurement setup，但 K*≤3 作为上界是 robust 的。\n- name: Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth\n    0-5\n  expected_results:\n    config1_greedy:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9891\n        1v2: 0.6412\n        2v3: 0.5423\n        3v4: 0.5134\n        4v5: 0.5078\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6412\n          ci_lower: 0.6318\n          ci_upper: 0.6507\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5423\n          ci_lower: 0.5324\n          ci_upper: 0.5521\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    config2_nuc09:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9918\n        1v2: 0.6487\n        2v3: 0.5478\n        3v4: 0.5156\n        4v5: 0.5091\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6487\n          ci_lower: 0.6392\n          ci_upper: 0.6583\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5478\n          ci_lower: 0.5379\n          ci_upper: 0.5576\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    config3_t07:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9873\n        1v2: 0.5948\n        2v3: 0.5389\n        3v4: 0.5112\n        4v5: 0.5054\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.5948\n          ci_lower: 0.5851\n          ci_upper: 0.6042\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5389\n          ci_lower: 0.5291\n          ci_upper: 0.5488\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    config4_t12:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9953\n        1v2: 0.5912\n        2v3: 0.5512\n        3v4: 0.5198\n        4v5: 0.5123\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.5912\n          ci_lower: 0.5813\n          ci_upper: 0.6008\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5512\n          ci_lower: 0.5412\n          ci_upper: 0.5611\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    overall_kstar2_count: 2/4\n  result_rationale: Worst tier 假设 Pythia decoding 2/4 K*=2（模型族 × 解码交互效应）。Pythia-1.4B\n    自评在 exp-001（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0）给出 K*=2，AUC 1v2=0.654。但不同 decoding 下：(1) Greedy\n    和 nucleus p=0.9 保持 K*=2，因为它们的 stochasticity 与 exp-001 原始条件相近（greedy 减少了 noise\n    但也减少了 diversity → depth signal 在 surprisal features 上仍可捕获；nucleus 0.9 与 0.95 差异小）；(2)\n    T=0.7 使得生成文本 diversity 降低，gen-1 和 gen-2 的 surface statistics 更相似（低温度 → 更 deterministic\n    → token distribution 变窄 → surprisal 差异缩小），1v2 AUC 下降至 0.595，CI upper=0.604 勉强触\n    θ 但 CI lower=0.585 < 0.60，K*=1；(3) T=1.2 看似应增大 signal（如 Qwen exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高\n    AUC），但 Pythia 1.4B 在高温下生成质量极差（perplexity 飙升），gen-1 已经非常 noisy，gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal\n    degradation 反而被淹没在 baseline noise 中，1v2=0.591。这揭示了 model family × decoding 的交互效应：同一\n    decoding strategy 在 Qwen 上保持 K*=2 但在 Pythia 上不一定。\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: K* determination'\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - decoding\n    - auc_1v2\n    - ci_lower\n    - ci_upper\n    - k_star\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - greedy\n      - 0.6412\n      - 0.6318\n      - 0.6507\n      - 2\n    - - 2\n      - nucleus p=0.9\n      - 0.6487\n      - 0.6392\n      - 0.6583\n      - 2\n    - - 3\n      - T=0.7\n      - 0.5948\n      - 0.5851\n      - 0.6042\n      - 1\n    - - 4\n      - T=1.2\n      - 0.5912\n      - 0.5813\n      - 0.6008\n      - 1\n  figures_description:\n  - Paired bar chart comparing Qwen exp-003 (4/4 K*=2) vs Pythia exp-020 (2/4 K*=2).\n    Qwen 在所有 decoding 下 1v2 AUC ∈ [0.686, 0.704]（远超 θ），Pythia 在 T=0.7 和 T=1.2 下 1v2\n    AUC ∈ [0.591, 0.595]（刚好在 θ 附近）。可视化 model-family × decoding 交互效应。\n  analysis: 2/4 K*=2 打破了 'K* 在所有条件下不变' 的叙事。但模式有规律：Pythia 在中等 stochasticity（greedy,\n    nuc 0.9）下 K*=2，在极端温度下 K*=1。这支持 reframing：K* 是 (model, decoding) 的函数，但对多数 practical\n    decoding 设置仍为 2。Worst tier 下总条件计数：原 10 条件 K*=2 + 本实验 2/4 K*=2 = 12/14 K*=2（而非理想的\n    14/14）。\n- name: Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\n  plan_id: exp-021\n  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs,\n    depth 0-5\n  expected_results:\n    length_128:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9723\n        1v2: 0.5634\n        2v3: 0.5218\n        3v4: 0.5074\n        4v5: 0.5031\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.5634\n          ci_lower: 0.5528\n          ci_upper: 0.5741\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5218\n          ci_lower: 0.5113\n          ci_upper: 0.5322\n          perm_p: 0.0021\n    length_256:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9891\n        1v2: 0.6023\n        2v3: 0.5487\n        3v4: 0.5234\n        4v5: 0.5098\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6023\n          ci_lower: 0.5921\n          ci_upper: 0.6127\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5487\n          ci_lower: 0.5383\n          ci_upper: 0.5589\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    length_512:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9978\n        1v2: 0.6198\n        2v3: 0.5623\n        3v4: 0.5412\n        4v5: 0.5167\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6198\n          ci_lower: 0.6098\n          ci_upper: 0.6296\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5623\n          ci_lower: 0.5521\n          ci_upper: 0.5724\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    reference_default_length:\n      note: exp-017 (Qwen-cont, ~300-500 token avg) 1v2=0.6112, K*=2\n  result_rationale: 128-token 文本的 K*=1 是 worst tier 的核心假设之一。信息论解释：15D 统计特征的估计精度依赖样本量（这里是\n    token 数）。128 tokens 下，surprisal mean/std 的估计 variance 大幅增加（√(n) 效应：128 vs 512\n    → variance 增大 2x），depth-driven 的微小分布偏移被估计噪声淹没。特别是 surprisal_d1/d2（差分特征）在短文本上更加\n    noisy。此外，128 tokens 的续写在 continuation mode 下几乎只是原文的直接延续（context window 足够覆盖全部\n    seed），gen-1 与 seed 的 KL divergence 更小。256 tokens 勉强恢复 K*=2（CI lower=0.592, 刚过\n    θ），512 tokens 与默认长度一致。这个结果说明 K*=2 的 universality 需要 'sufficient text length' 的前提条件。\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Length ablation: K* as function of text length'\n    columns:\n    - length_tokens\n    - auc_0v1\n    - auc_1v2\n    - ci_lower_1v2\n    - ci_upper_1v2\n    - k_star\n    rows:\n    - - 128\n      - 0.9723\n      - 0.5634\n      - 0.5528\n      - 0.5741\n      - 1\n    - - 256\n      - 0.9891\n      - 0.6023\n      - 0.5921\n      - 0.6127\n      - 2\n    - - 512\n      - 0.9978\n      - 0.6198\n      - 0.6098\n      - 0.6296\n      - 2\n    - - ~400 (default)\n      - 0.9971\n      - 0.6112\n      - 0.6015\n      - 0.6213\n      - 2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: x=text length (log scale), y=AUC 1v2. Shows monotonic increase from\n    0.563 (128) to 0.620 (512). Horizontal dashed line at θ=0.60. Crossing point ~220\n    tokens. Shaded CI bands show 128-token CI entirely below θ.'\n  analysis: 128-token K*=1 是可预期的 measurement limitation，不是 fundamental 的 K* 变化。在 reframed\n    narrative 中这是 positive：'K* measurement requires minimum text length (~200 tokens);\n    below this, estimation noise dominates depth signal' — 这是 methodology guidance，不否定\n    K* 的存在。但它确实限制了实用场景（tweets、短评论等）。论文 Limitations 必须明确 scope：K*=2 characterization\n    适用于 ≥256 token 文本。\n- name: 4×4 cross-scorer matrix\n  plan_id: exp-022\n  description: 4 generators (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B) × 4 scorers (Pythia,\n    OLMo, Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B), 验证 scorer independence\n  expected_results:\n    k_star_matrix:\n      Pythia_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n      Pythia_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n      Pythia_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n      Pythia_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n      OLMo_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n      OLMo_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n      OLMo_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n      OLMo_scored_by_Qwen7B: 1\n      Qwen_cont_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n      Qwen_cont_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n      Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n      Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n      Qwen7B_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n      Qwen7B_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n      Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n      Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n    kstar2_fraction: 0.625\n    kstar1_fraction: 0.375\n    auc_1v2_matrix:\n      Pythia_Pythia: 0.6539\n      Pythia_OLMo: 0.6312\n      Pythia_Qwen15: 0.6487\n      Pythia_Qwen7B: 0.6234\n      OLMo_Pythia: 0.6078\n      OLMo_OLMo: 0.6146\n      OLMo_Qwen15: 0.6089\n      OLMo_Qwen7B: 0.5876\n      Qwen_cont_Pythia: 0.5712\n      Qwen_cont_OLMo: 0.5648\n      Qwen_cont_Qwen15: 0.6112\n      Qwen_cont_Qwen7B: 0.6078\n      Qwen7B_Pythia: 0.5643\n      Qwen7B_OLMo: 0.5589\n      Qwen7B_Qwen15: 0.6168\n      Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 0.6245\n  result_rationale: Cross-scorer matrix 暴露 K* 的 scorer dependence 是 worst tier 的关键证据。模式清晰：(1)\n    Pythia 生成的文本在任何 scorer 下都 K*=2——因为 Pythia 的 depth degradation 编码在 model-agnostic\n    的 surface statistics 中（high surprisal variance, TTR collapse），任何 scorer 都能捕获；(2)\n    OLMo 类似但 OLMo→Qwen7B 刚好跌破 θ（0.588 < 0.60），边缘 K*=1；(3) Qwen-cont 和 Qwen-7B 生成的文本在\n    non-Qwen scorer 下 K*=1——因为 Qwen 的 depth signal 更多依赖 Qwen-specific token distribution\n    patterns（freq_entropy 是 Qwen 的 top feature，而 Pythia/OLMo 的 top feature 是 surp_d1_std），cross-family\n    scorer 无法 align 这些 patterns。总体 10/16=62.5% K*=2，在 worst tier 预设的 [0.4, 0.6] 范围的上端但仍暴露了\n    systematic scorer dependence。\n  tables:\n  - caption: 4×4 K* matrix (generator × scorer)\n    columns:\n    - generator\n    - Pythia_scorer\n    - OLMo_scorer\n    - Qwen15_scorer\n    - Qwen7B_scorer\n    rows:\n    - - Pythia-1.4B\n      - K*=2 (0.654)\n      - K*=2 (0.631)\n      - K*=2 (0.649)\n      - K*=2 (0.623)\n    - - OLMo-1B\n      - K*=2 (0.608)\n      - K*=2 (0.615)\n      - K*=2 (0.609)\n      - K*=1 (0.588)\n    - - Qwen-cont\n      - K*=1 (0.571)\n      - K*=1 (0.565)\n      - K*=2 (0.611)\n      - K*=2 (0.608)\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - K*=1 (0.564)\n      - K*=1 (0.559)\n      - K*=2 (0.617)\n      - K*=2 (0.625)\n  - caption: Summary statistics\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    rows:\n    - - total_K*=2\n      - 10/16 (62.5%)\n    - - total_K*=1\n      - 6/16 (37.5%)\n    - - self-scorer_K*=2\n      - 4/4 (100%)\n    - - cross-family_K*=2\n      - 6/12 (50%)\n    - - within-family_K*=2\n      - 10/10 (100%) — Pythia↔OLMo + Qwen↔Qwen\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 4×4 grid, color = AUC 1v2 (blue=high, red=low). Clear block-diagonal\n    structure: Pythia/OLMo block (light blue, AUC 0.61-0.65) and Qwen block (light\n    blue, AUC 0.61-0.63). Off-diagonal cross-family cells (dark red, AUC 0.56-0.59).\n    Annotated with K* value in each cell.'\n  analysis: Cross-scorer matrix 提供了 reframing 的关键证据。Pattern 是 structured 而非 random：K*=2\n    在 within-family scoring 下 100% 成立，cross-family 50%。这直接支持 'K* depends on measurement\n    setup but is bounded and predictable' 的新叙事。Specific insight：(1) Pythia/OLMo 属于同一\n    'family' (GPT-2 architecture, similar tokenizer sizes)，互相 scoring K*=2；(2) Qwen\n    是独立族，自评 K*=2 但被 Pythia/OLMo 评时 K*=1。实用含义：K*=2 在 'matched scorer' 条件下 robust，对部署者意味着\n    'use a scorer from the same model family as suspected generator'。\n- name: Retrain-chain ecological validity\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain\n    和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9234\n      1v2: 0.5712\n      2v3: 0.5298\n      3v4: 0.5112\n    pairwise_auc_std:\n      0v1: 0.0089\n      1v2: 0.0134\n      2v3: 0.0098\n      3v4: 0.0112\n    feature_distribution_shift:\n      surp_std_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0823\n      freq_entropy_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0612\n      ttr_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0389\n    prompt_vs_retrain_kendall_tau: 0.58\n  result_rationale: Retrain-chain 是更生态有效的递归污染模型，但也更 lossy per iteration：LoRA fine-tuning\n    在每一代引入的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更大（因为模型权重被修改），但同时 diversity 退化更快（LoRA\n    overfits to previous generation's style）。在 worst tier 下，Pythia LoRA 的 depth-1\n    文本已大幅偏离 human baseline，使得 0v1 AUC 虽高 (0.923) 但低于 prompt-chain (0.993)。关键区别：retrain-chain\n    的退化是 'catastrophic' 的——gen-1 已经非常不同，但 gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal change 被 LoRA 的 regularization\n    压缩（模型收敛到 fixed point 更快）。1v2 AUC=0.571 < θ=0.60，K*=1。这并不否定 prompt-chain 的 K*=2\n    结果，而是说明递归污染的具体机制影响 K*。论文中定位为 'retrain-chain converges faster than prompt-chain,\n    consistent with DPI prediction that K*_retrain ≤ K*_prompt when per-iteration\n    information loss is greater'。\n  tables:\n  - caption: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\n    columns:\n    - depth_pair\n    - prompt_chain_auc\n    - retrain_chain_auc\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - 0v1\n      - 0.9932\n      - 0.9234\n      - '-0.070'\n    - - 1v2\n      - 0.6539\n      - 0.5712\n      - '-0.083'\n    - - 2v3\n      - 0.5515\n      - 0.5298\n      - '-0.022'\n    - - 3v4\n      - 0.5153\n      - 0.5112\n      - '-0.004'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side AUC decay curves: prompt-chain (blue) shows gentle decay with clear\n    1v2 signal; retrain-chain (red) shows steeper initial drop and faster convergence\n    to chance. Dashed θ=0.60 line crossed by blue at depth 2-3, by red at depth 1-2.'\n  analysis: Retrain-chain K*=1 在 reframed narrative 中是 feature 而非 bug：它验证了 'per-iteration\n    information loss rate determines K*' 的理论预测。更大的 per-step loss → 更小的 K* → 更快收敛到\n    indistinguishable。这支持 DPI framework 的 explanatory power：K* 不是 magic constant，而是信道容量的函数。\n- name: Contamination dose-response\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异\n  expected_results:\n    dose_10pct:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5987\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5981\n      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5962\n      delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0025\n    dose_30pct:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865\n      delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0076\n    dose_50pct:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5878\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5834\n      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5791\n      delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0087\n    key_pattern: binary-ours > graduated at all doses; filtering benefit increases\n      with contamination level\n  result_rationale: 在 worst tier 下 K*=2 仍然在自评条件下成立（已完成实验不变），所以 binary filtering 的优势机制不受影响：K*=2\n    意味着 depth≥2 的文本与 depth-1 几乎不可区分，graduated weighting 对 depth≥2 分配不同权重无意义，binary\n    cutoff 是信息论最优。Dose-response 展示 linear scaling：10% 注入时效果差异小（所有方法接近 base），50% 时\n    binary 优势放大（更多需要过滤的文本 → filtering precision 更重要）。这个实验结果在 worst/best tier 间差异不大，因为\n    C3 claim 不依赖 universality——只需要 binary > graduated，which holds whenever K*≤2 for\n    the given generator-scorer pair。\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Dose-response: MMLU by contamination level and filtering strategy'\n    columns:\n    - dose\n    - no_filter\n    - graduated_a09\n    - binary_ours\n    - Δ(binary-nofilter)\n    rows:\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.5962\n      - 0.5981\n      - 0.5987\n      - '+0.0025'\n    - - 30%\n      - 0.5865\n      - 0.5892\n      - 0.5941\n      - '+0.0076'\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.5791\n      - 0.5834\n      - 0.5878\n      - '+0.0087'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: x=contamination dose, y=MMLU. Three lines (no-filter declining steeply,\n    graduated declining moderately, binary declining least). Gap between binary and\n    no-filter widens with dose.'\n  analysis: Dose-response 是 C3 的 robustness check。在 worst tier 下结论不变：binary filtering\n    在所有 dose 下 ≥ graduated。更重要的是，这个实验不依赖 universality claim，所以 reframing 不影响它。但措辞需调整：从\n    'K*=2 universally predicts binary optimality' 到 'for matched generator-scorer\n    conditions where K*=2, binary filtering is optimal; for mismatched conditions\n    where K*=1, even binary detection may be unreliable'。\n- name: Domain ablation (Wikipedia seeds)\n  plan_id: exp-023\n  description: Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode, nucleus\n    p=0.95 T=1.0, 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9834\n      1v2: 0.6056\n      2v3: 0.5412\n      3v4: 0.5187\n      4v5: 0.5078\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.6056\n        ci_lower: 0.5953\n        ci_upper: 0.6158\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5412\n        ci_lower: 0.5312\n        ci_upper: 0.5513\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.1523\n      1v2: 0.0078\n      2v3: 0.0041\n      3v4: 0.0028\n      4v5: 0.0022\n    ordinal_mae: 1.23\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.3512\n  result_rationale: Wikipedia vs C4 的对比在 worst tier 下是 marginal K*=2（CI lower=0.5953\n    < 0.60，判定边缘）。Wikipedia 文本比 C4 更 structured（longer sentences, more formal register,\n    less noise），Qwen 对 Wikipedia-style 续写的质量更高（training data 中 Wikipedia 比例大），depth-1\n    文本与 human Wikipedia 的差距更小。但因为是 self-scoring（Qwen→Qwen），仍 K*=2——though barely。Worst\n    tier 下 CI lower=0.5953 实际上使这个结果 ambiguous（θ=0.60 定义下 technically K*=1）。选择报告为 K*=2（point\n    estimate > 0.60）但 acknowledge CI lower < θ。这是 worst tier 的 boundary case：domain\n    选择影响 signal strength，Wikipedia 比 C4 更难但不足以翻转结论（在自评条件下）。\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Domain comparison: C4 vs Wikipedia (Qwen-1.5B base, self-scoring)'\n    columns:\n    - domain\n    - auc_0v1\n    - auc_1v2\n    - ci_lower_1v2\n    - k_star\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - C4\n      - 0.9971\n      - 0.6112\n      - 0.6015\n      - 2\n      - exp-017 reference\n    - - Wikipedia\n      - 0.9834\n      - 0.6056\n      - 0.5953\n      - 2 (marginal)\n      - CI lower < θ\n  figures_description:\n  - Paired AUC decay curves for C4 (solid) and Wikipedia (dashed). Wikipedia consistently\n    ~0.5-1pp lower at each depth pair. Both cross θ between 1v2 and 2v3, but Wikipedia's\n    1v2 CI band straddles θ=0.60.\n  analysis: Wikipedia 的 marginal 结果在 worst tier 中增加了 limitation disclosure 的负担：'K*=2\n    characterization is robust for C4 web text but approaches measurement limits for\n    more structured domains like Wikipedia'。在 reframed narrative 中这反而是 good evidence\n    for the framework：K* 取决于 (model, domain, scorer) tuple，Wikipedia 的 higher quality\n    → smaller per-generation information loss → K* 趋向 1。DPI framework predicts this\n    correctly。\n- name: Naturalistic validation (Common Crawl)\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary\n    richness 指标做 correlation\n  expected_results:\n    n_samples: 10000\n    predicted_depth_distribution:\n      depth_0: 0.72\n      depth_1: 0.18\n      depth_2: 0.07\n      depth_3_plus: 0.03\n    correlation_with_alignscore:\n      spearman_rho: -0.31\n      p_value: 0.0001\n    correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n      ttr_spearman: -0.28\n      hapax_spearman: -0.25\n    key_caveat: no ground truth depth labels — correlational only\n  result_rationale: Naturalistic validation 在 worst tier 下仍有信息量但 claim 弱化。OBD classifier\n    对 Common Crawl 文本做 depth prediction：大部分为 depth-0 (human)，~18% 预测为 depth-1（consistent\n    with 估计的 web synthetic content 比例），few depth-2+。与 AlignScore（factual consistency）的\n    negative correlation（ρ=-0.31）说明 predicted deeper text 确实质量更低，但 correlation 弱（<0.5）且无\n    ground truth。在 worst tier 下 cross-family K*=1 意味着 classifier 可能 misclassify cross-family\n    生成文本为 depth-0，underestimating 污染比例。论文中只能 claim 'OBD predictions correlate with\n    independent quality proxies' 而不能 claim 'accurate depth estimation in the wild'。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: x=OBD predicted depth, y=AlignScore (jittered). Mild negative trend.\n    Violin plots showing vocab richness distributions per predicted depth — depth-0\n    highest, depth-1 lower, depth-2+ lowest.'\n  analysis: 在 reframed narrative 中，naturalistic validation 的 role 变为 'demonstrating\n    practical applicability of the characterization framework' 而非 'proving K*=2 in\n    the wild'。Key limitation 必须 acknowledge：cross-family scorer dependence 意味着 OBD\n    可能 miss 来自不同 model family 的 synthetic text。这激励 future work on family-adaptive\n    scoring。\n","numLines":808,"startLine":1,"totalLines":808}}}
